# Grauberg - Dominion Op #01 (abyssea 115, op 588), through the sergeant: a level 99 Warrior in Abyssea - Grauberg
# beside DSgt_Wolfgang. No active op: 500 (the packed influence, the op mask, the notes); update on option 18
# (type 2, op 1): updateEvent(5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 588); finished on 18: the op added (player:addQuest),
# activeDominionOp 588, DOMINION_SIGNED_ON. DSgt_Wolfgang with the op on: 500 (the op, 5, 0, status 1), finished on 0:
# nothing. Five Sinister_Seidel killed: Prog 1 to 5. DSgt_Wolfgang (5 of 5): 500 (status 2); finished on 8 (type 8):
# completeDominionOp: the op completed, 1000 exp, 200 cruor, 100 dominion notes, the vars cleared. A Sinister_Seidel
# killed: completed: nothing. Signed on again (18): addQuest leaves the completed op completed, so a Sinister_Seidel
# killed counts nothing; DSgt_Wolfgang: 500 (the op, 5, 0, status 1). Cancelled (3): delQuest, the vars cleared,
# CANCELED_OBJECTIVE; a Sinister_Seidel killed: nothing. Op #02 signed on (34: type 2, op 2): a Monitor killed:
# Quest[8][116]Prog 1. The status changes are all the global's (globals/abyssea/dominion.lua); the C# quests are the
# count only. Perfect Dodge, Invincible and Elemental Sforzo (GM effects) keep the chars alive through the kills (the
# Abyssea mobs aggro and link).
lists AbysseaGrauberg/Sinister_Seidel/onMobDeath AbysseaGrauberg/Monitor/onMobDeath AbysseaGrauberg/DSgt_Wolfgang/onTrigger AbysseaGrauberg/onEventUpdate/500 AbysseaGrauberg/onEventFinish/500
char zone=AbysseaGrauberg pos=798.628,31.45,472.778 job=WAR lvl=99
login
effect 49                               # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
effect 50                               # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
